Subject: [PATCH v3 2/2] remoteproc: stm32: add capability to detach
Date:   Fri, 26 Mar 2021 10:42:09 +0100
Message-ID: <20210326094209.29750-3-arnaud.pouliquen@foss.st.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.17.1
